@startuml act_project_lifecycle
title Activity — Project Lifecycle (from creation to review)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

|Administrator|
start
:Create user accounts;
:Maintain resources\nand yearly TCC;

|Director|
:Create the project\n(identification sheet);
:Assign the project manager;
:Enter the Internal Quote\n(economic baseline);

|Project Manager|
:Build the team;
:Plan the workload;
:Billing, missions,\ngovernance;

|Developer|
repeat :Submit monthly\nactual workload;

|Project Manager|
:Validate workload;
:Monthly review:\nenter EV %, freeze snapshot;
repeat while (project active?) is (yes)
-> no;

|Director|
:Close (COMPLETED)\nthen archive;
stop

@enduml
